{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Arial;}{\f1 Calibri;}}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl240\fs24\b Hitfit Tribe - Coach Profile\b0\par\par \f1 Coach: Hitendra Choudhary\par Specialization: Running Coach and Endurance Mentor\par Focus: Beginner runners, 5K/10K athletes, half-marathon preparation, strength, mobility, and confidence-building\par\par Professional Summary:\par Hitendra Choudhary is a passionate running coach dedicated to helping everyday athletes build strong foundations, improve endurance, and develop confidence through structured, sustainable training. His coaching philosophy combines smart training progression, strength work, lifestyle habits, and mental resilience.\par\par Coaching Style:\par - Beginner-friendly and encouraging\par - Goal-oriented and individualized\par - Rooted in consistency over intensity\par - Focus on injury prevention, mobility, and progression\par\par Training Philosophy:\par "Running is not just about speed. It is about discipline, trust in the process, and the ability to keep showing up."\par\par Areas of Support:\par - Personal performance coaching\par - Race preparation for 5K, 10K, and half marathon\par - Strength and conditioning for runners\par - Recovery planning\par - Habit-building and accountability\par\par Contact and Enquiries:\par Use the contact form on the website or connect through the website CTA to start your training journey.\par}\pard\par